{"story":{"group_1":[{"autoTurnLast":0.01,"bg":"bg_adv_13121.jpg","bgm":"bgm03_story19","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":102501,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":300201,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"chara":[{"id":102501,"motion":300}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"咦，又有……？","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":300201}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textRight":"怎么了？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_001.exp.json","id":102501,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"刚才在那家店的时候，@我就有些在意了……"},{"chara":[{"id":102501}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"今天好像到处都能@看到“巧克力”呢。"},{"chara":[{"id":102501,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"现在是巧克力应季的时候吗？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":300201,"motion":300,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textRight":"是不是应季，@我就不太清楚了……"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":300201}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textRight":"不过，到处都在卖巧克力，@是因为情人节快到了呀。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":102501,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"情人……？@[chara:102501:lipSynch_0][wait:0.8][chara:102501:cheek_0][chara:102501:face_mtn_ex_030.exp.json][chara:102501:lipSynch_1]那是什么？"},{"chara":[{"id":300201,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textRight":"情人节，@就是2月14日……"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":300201}],"nameNarration":"空穗夏希","narration":"“这一天，女孩子会把巧克力@送给喜欢的男孩子，向他告白。@是每年只有一次的重要日子！”","narrationBg":"","narrationEffect":"in"},{"chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":102501,"motion":400}],"nameLeft":"静香","narrationEffect":"out","textLeft":"告白……"},{"chara":[{"id":300201,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textRight":"爱实也……"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"id":102501,"motion":1}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"爱实……？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":300201}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textRight":"啊，爱实是@我一个朋友的名字……"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":300201,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textRight":"她也为了情人节，@在做各种准备呢。"},{"chara":[{"id":300201,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textRight":"还说今年一定要告白……！"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":102501,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"……也就是说，对女孩子而言，@这是个很重要的日子吧。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":300201}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textRight":"没错！"},{"chara":[{"id":102501}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"……难得有这样的日子，@我也想参加看看。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":102501,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"可是，我没有想告白的对象呀……"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":300201,"motion":1}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textRight":"也不一定非得告白，"},{"chara":[{"id":300201}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textRight":"还可以把巧克力@送给恋人，或是特别的人。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":300201}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textRight":"表达爱意，或是平日里的感谢。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":102501,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"也可以送给恋人或特别的人……？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":300201,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textRight":"啊，你有这样的人吗……！"},{"chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":102501,"motion":200,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"是啊……@不过，特意说出来还有点难为情……"},{"chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":300201,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textRight":"哇……这样啊，也是呢！@毕竟静香你这么有魅力。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":102501,"motion":400,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"咦、咦……？@怎么突然说起这个来了？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":300201,"motion":300}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textRight":"嘿嘿……"},{"chara":[{"id":300201}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textRight":"可能是受了@刚才提到的那个朋友的影响，"},{"chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":300201}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textRight":"最近对这类话题，@我也变得有点敏感了……"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"id":102501,"lipSynch":0,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"……？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":102501,"motion":1}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"对了，除了送“巧克力”以外，@还会做些什么呢？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":300201,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textRight":"有特别的人的话，@还可以约会之类的……？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp.json","id":102501}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"约会……？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp.json","id":300201}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textRight":"就是……[chara:300201:lipSynch_0][wait:0.8][chara:300201:eyeClose_0][chara:300201:cheek_0][chara:300201:face_mtn_ex_010.exp.json][chara:300201:lipSynch_1]一起出门玩！"},{"chara":[{"id":300201,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textRight":"和特别的人两个人@一起出门玩，就叫约会。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":102501,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"原来在外面，两个人一起出门，@就叫“约会”啊。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":102501}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"我记住了！"},{"chara":[{"id":300201,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textRight":"时间合适的话，@不如邀请对方试试看？"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_001.exp.json","id":102501,"motion":300,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"也是呢……"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":102501,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"…………"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":102501,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"嗯！"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp.json","id":102501,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"难得过一次情人节，@我就去邀请一下吧。"},{"chara":[{"id":102501,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"毕竟平时很少有机会@两个人一起出门，"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":102501}],"nameLeft":"静香","textLeft":"这正好是个好机会呢。"},{"chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp.json","id":300201,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"空穗夏希","textBg":"shout","textRight":"冲呀！冲呀！加油！！@一定要成功哦！"},{"autoTurnLast":2,"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"}]},"version":3}